    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Response Workflow",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Security Response Workflow\n\n1. Confirm active alert count and severity.\n2. Identify the highest-risk signal: authentication abuse, invalid tokens, permission abuse, rate limiting, or privilege activity.\n3. Review the matching trend panel and event stream.\n4. Capture time window, affected service, source IP/user/role, request ID, and trace ID.\n5. Cross-check service health and synthetic probes.\n6. Follow the matching runbook and document action taken.\n"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
